    skos:definition "Compounds having the structure $\\ce{R2C(OR')2}$ ($\\ce{R'} \\neq \\ce{H}$) and thus diethers of geminal diols. Originally, the term was confined to derivatives of aldehydes (one $\\ce{R = H}$), but it now applies equally to derivatives of ketones (neither $\\ce{R = H}$). Mixed acetals have different $\\ce{R'}$ groups."@en ;
    skos:inScheme goldbook: ;
    skos:prefLabel "acetals"@en ;
    skos:topConceptOf goldbook: ;
    prov:hadPrimarySource <https://doi.org/10.1351/goldbook.A00062> ;
.

