    skos:definition "The arsanyl cation, $\\ce{H2As^{+}}$, and derivatives by substitution. The name arsinylium (systematically derived from arsine) is not applied as it already designates $\\ce{H2As(=O)^{+}}$, the acylium ion derived from arsinic acid."@en ;
    skos:inScheme goldbook: ;
