    skos:definition "Stems in a crystal having opposite side-group orientations with respect to the chain axis (see (a) in figure).(a) Pairs of anticlined stems and (b) pairs of isoclined stems of regioregular poly(3-butylthiophene), i.e., poly(3-n-butylthiophene-2,5-diyl). Since regioregular poly(3-n-butylthiophene-2,5-diyl) is also a directional chain, (a) is an example of antidirectional packing of two chains, while (b) is an example of isodirectional packing."@en ;
    skos:inScheme goldbook: ;
    skos:prefLabel "anticlined stems"@en ;
