    skos:definition "For a substance \\(\\ce{B}\\), activity coefficient \\(f_{\\ce{B}}\\) extrapolated to infinite dilution: \\[\\ln (f_{\\ce{B}}^{\\infty}) = \\lim \\limits_{x_{\\ce{B}} \\to 0} (\\frac{\\mu_{\\ce{B}} - \\mu_{\\ce{B}}^{\\ast}}{RT} - \\ln x_{\\ce{B}})\\]"@en ;
